          {
            "sourceIndex": 2,
            "text": "Add the sour cream and stir again.",
            "mediaId": "wordpress-attachment:15513"
          },
          {
            "sourceIndex": 3,
            "text": "Transfer ganache to the pastry bag or small ziplock bag. Allow to cool for about 2 hours at room temperature or 30 minutes in the refrigerator.",
            "mediaId": null
          },
          {
            "sourceIndex": 4,
            "text": "Pipe the ganache filling in the middle of one shell (about 1 tsp).",
            "mediaId": "wordpress-attachment:15527"
          },
          {
            "sourceIndex": 5,
            "text": "Sandwich it with empty shell. Store them in the refrigerator for at least 6 hours before serving. They'll taste even better next day. 😉",
            "mediaId": "wordpress-attachment:15543"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
